forums, Reddit...

00:14:33.856 --> 00:14:37.110
Like, I read people's comments,
that's why I have a pulse.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.120
I'm an anthropologist.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.030
I'm a strategist that way.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.750
So, you know, I believe in it.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.710
I believe it's putting in the work.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.900
It's it's like pushups.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.970
I think everyone here
working on their craft,

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.347
and things of that nature,

00:14:49.347 --> 00:14:52.270
doing push-ups, if you do eight
them, certain things happen.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.530
If you do 80 of them a day,
a different thing happens.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.710
Now we all have different
muscle composition.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.170
So some of us may show more

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.730
but the work is the work is the work.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.250
It does matter.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.083
- Oh my God

