00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:46.090
or if I wasn't doing the
right thing by people,

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.670
or, you know, I have the receipts,

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:49.920
they're all on the internet.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.944
You go look back at my
stuff that I talked about

00:15:51.944 --> 00:15:54.740
in '09,'10, '11', '12, '13...

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:58.030
A remarkable percentage became true.

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:00.290
That's going to give me affirmation

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.760
of a reputation.
- Right.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.410
- You know, people talk
about personal brand

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.420
