like, I hate that term.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.650
I'm like call it what you want.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.750
It's called your reputation.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.040
You know, me being right
about a lot of things

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:13.933
was better for me than me
being wrong about those things.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.810
- Okay, so this is insane,
because when you told me about

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.120
how you respond to every
single email, I was like,

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.760
