replying on Instagram.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.670
- Oh, last night, correct.
- Last night, right.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.410
- Now, that was a little different.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.430
Similar, but different.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:40.430
Last night I was reading
comments about subject matters.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.410
I did reply to some of
my stuff, to your point.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.460
It was not... you know, I
remember when I was doing it,

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.060
everyone's like, it's not
